  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide Tristan Da Cunha Administration financial support that allows them to deliver public services including health, education, safeguarding and governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To provide Tristan Da Cunha Administration financial support that allows them to deliver public services including health, education, safeguarding and governance  is a component of Tristan da Cunha: Provision of Technical Assistance and Capacity Building 2018-2022	 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;4,006,242. It works in the following sector(s): Basic health care, Financial policy and administrative management, Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322), Human rights, Primary education.</narrative>
  </description>
